        "o": ["A tree without roots", "Sending away a cold, hungry person with only warm words but no practical help", "A lamp without oil", "Planting seeds on rocky ground"],
        "a": 1,
        "e": "James 2:15–16: if a brother or sister lacks food and clothing and you say 'Go in peace' without giving them what they need, it is useless. Similarly, faith-words without faith-deeds are useless.",
        "h": "Hungry/cold person given only words = illustration of dead faith.",
        "yr": "SS1"
