        "a": 1,
        "e": "Demons acknowledge God's existence and shudder — but this does not save them. Saving faith is more than intellectual agreement; it involves wholehearted trust and commitment that produces transformation.",
        "h": "Demons believe intellectually but are not saved — faith is more than knowledge.",
